    },
    {
      "id": "76rkq4sv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 490,
      "y": 1079,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 25095,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 71385,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "67 size classes: 8B 16B 32B 48B 64B 80B ...\nEach P has its own mcache -> zero contention\n\nmcache.alloc[sizeClass] -> mspan.freeindex\nBump-pointer allocation: freeindex++\n\nOn mcache miss: get mspan from mcentral\nOn mcentral miss: allocate from mheap\nReturned mspan tracked for GC sweep",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "67 size classes: 8B 16B 32B 48B 64B 80B ...\nEach P has its own mcache -> zero contention\n\nmcache.alloc[sizeClass] -> mspan.freeindex\nBump-pointer allocation: freeindex++\n\nOn mcache miss: get mspan from mcentral\nOn mcentral miss: allocate from mheap\nReturned mspan tracked for GC sweep",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
