      "versionNonce": 79391,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MENTAL MODEL: Goroutine stack = personal scratch pad (2KB, auto-erased on return, cheap as a function call).\n   Go heap = shared office filing system (GC empties it). Java heap = nursery (Eden) + storage (Old Gen) + library (Meta).\nPERF: GOGC=200 for batch/throughput | GOMEMLIMIT=512MiB for containers | sync.Pool for hot-path alloc reuse",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MENTAL MODEL: Goroutine stack = personal scratch pad (2KB, auto-erased on return, cheap as a function call).\n   Go heap = shared office filing system (GC empties it). Java heap = nursery (Eden) + storage (Old Gen) + library (Meta).\nPERF: GOGC=200 for batch/throughput | GOMEMLIMIT=512MiB for containers | sync.Pool for hot-path alloc reuse",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
